    <p class="prose" style="margin-top:8px;">Recurring weekly accounts like this also run on a structured payment-schedule and invoicing workflow I built to keep billing organized and traceable instead of rebuilt from scratch every cycle. What's actually in any client's invoices stays private. That's real financial data.</p>
