        <rect x="18.5" y="9" width="3" height="11" rx="1" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        <rect x="24" y="14" width="2" height="6" rx="1" fill="var(--gold)" opacity=".5"/>
      </svg>
      The Review Desk.
    </h2>
    <p class="lede">The actual tool I use to review footage and leave timecoded notes. Local-first. Nothing leaves this computer. Click it to see it loaded.</p>

    <div class="rd-frame">
