  <section id="shea" class="bg-grey bordered"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Inside CORTEX</p>
    <h2 class="display">And on the customer side: Shea.</h2>
    <p class="lede">The Verse is the production-side system. Shea is the customer-facing one, built and maintained for Shear Media Studios.</p>
    <p class="prose">Shea is an AI chat concierge embedded on shearmediastudios.com. A visitor opens the widget, registers, and talks through what they need: which studio, rough scope, the same conversation a human would have at the front desk. Shea turns that into a structured project brief and routes it to the studio's team for a human to follow up and close. It doesn't book anything, sign anything, or take payment. It qualifies the lead and cuts the back-and-forth before a real booking call ever happens.</p>

    <p class="prose">Most people don't walk in with a finished brief. They walk in with an idea, a deadline, maybe a reference clip they liked. So Shea asks the same questions I'd ask at the front desk myself: who's this for, what has to actually happen in the room, is this a studio day or does it travel, how many people are on camera, is it a one-off or does it come back every week. Simple questions. They're also the ones that turn "we need a podcast" into something a crew can plan around before anybody picks up the phone.</p>

    <div class="shea-card">
      <div class="shea-mark">S</div>
      <div class="shea-chat">
        <p class="shea-label">What a visitor sees, live on shearmediastudios.com</p>
        <p class="shea-line"><b>Shea:</b> Hey, welcome to Shear Media Studios. I'm Shea, the studio's AI concierge. What are you thinking about making: a podcast, marketing content, a commercial, a live show, or something else?</p>
        <p class="shea-line shea-line--user"><b>Visitor:</b> I need a podcast studio for a weekly show.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connect-graph" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <div class="connect-node"><div class="connect-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M6 20c0-4 3-6 6-6s6 2 6 6"/></svg></div><p class="connect-label">Visitor</p></div>
